@startuml
title BlueDocs - Classes du domaine
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class User {
  +id: bigint
  +name: string
  +email: string <<unique>>
  +role: string = editeur
  +email_verified_at: timestamp?
  +password: string
  +remember_token: string?
  +last_login_at: timestamp?
  +created_at: timestamp?
  +updated_at: timestamp?
}

class Document {
  +id: bigint
  +slug: string <<unique, route key>>
  +title: string
  +content: longtext
  +user_name: string
  +updated_by: bigint?
  +created_at: timestamp?
  +updated_at: timestamp?
  --
  +getRouteKeyName(): string
}

User "0..1" <-- "0..*" Document : dernier éditeur\n(updated_by)

note right of Document
  Le slug identifie la fiche dans les URL.
  Il reste stable si le titre change.
  La suppression du User référencé
  met updated_by à NULL.
end note
@enduml
